<title>USA: U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA rice export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 53,800 MT fell 57 percent from last week's marketing-year high and 37 percent below the 4-week average. Saudi Arabia (31,800 MT), Turkey (12,500 MT), and Mexico (3,300 MT, of which 3,100 MT was rough) were the primary buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 33,700 MT were 47 percent below the prior week and 29 percent under the 4-week average.  The major destinations were Japan (10,200 MT), Saudi Arabia (9,400 MT), Mexico (3,900 MT), and Liberia (3,300 MT).</p>
</text>
